{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-deep-research#card-zh","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-deep-research","commit":"c0b329e02cd0195f810a7c3608cb58701a7fe0f1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deep-research 是面向 DSH 的研究插件，在工具注册表中提供 deep_research，并通过官方 workflows 服务运行研究流程。它先界定研究范围和信息维度，再并行研究子问题，根据高优先级信息缺口继续规划轮次，直到达到深度上限或缺口收敛。研究者将发现分为已确认、不确定和缺口，综合阶段生成保留置信度与矛盾的报告，也可启用引用和覆盖度审查。用户可提供主题、用途或问题清单，调整研究深度、并发数及各角色模型。适合需要多源资料调查和带引用报告的 DSH 用户；profile 需提供官方 workflow 与内置网页搜索工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:62-85","src/index.ts:207-370","src/index.ts:453-536"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-deep-research#card-en","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-deep-research","commit":"c0b329e02cd0195f810a7c3608cb58701a7fe0f1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-deep-research adds a DSH tool for adaptive research. It plans questions, investigates them in parallel, follows important gaps, and produces a cited report with optional review. Users can set depth, concurrency, and role models. Requires the official workflow service and built-in web tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:62-85","src/index.ts:207-370","src/index.ts:453-536"]}
